# The scoping suite's stand-in knowledge-graph content (S0.5 Pass B2, group 4;
# Cyril's step 2 harness, KG block): the one class axiom the shape forms read
# through the hierarchy. Added to kg/domain of the suite's own store only, as
# a knowledge-graph load stands in (Graph Store Protocol, unvalidated). The
# Cafe's Order and OrderLine classes are already in kg/domain (the real load).
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix cafe: <urn:ontara:standin:cafe#> .

cafe:Drink rdfs:subClassOf cafe:MenuItem .
